{"seq":16,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T01:10:45.367Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"776c9f4a8b5bcd11cd4a2af428bf2c46138f22ba2fd6a3f83406f44d93bb2839","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"Ruth, from Moss's digests in teams/team-strategic (I read the files directly, not just the search index):\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It changed hands on 2026-05-04. Moss's 5/3 prep note says it changes hands tomorrow, and the 5/4 digest records the reassignment as effective that day. Later digests (8/3, 9/30) and the QBR plan call it Gideon's account. Caveat: the undated cheat sheet and the 4/27 digest still say \"Nadia's industrial account\", so that note may be stale.\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he assumed management that day, and later digests agree.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato in the latest digests (9/30/2026 and 12/1/2025 both say \"Gideon's medical account\"). The 3/10/2025 digest still called it Nadia's, and no transfer date is recorded, so confirm with Moss or the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: I could not find an owner in the digests. They mention its tickets but never name who runs the account.\n\nFor the board slide, please confirm Orlavine and Quillfeather with Moss or the CRM before you publish.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
